 | SCENARIO-KAN-5254 | Convex envelope certificate certifies true bound and rejects false bound | Implemented | Artifact records a bounded two-variable additive quadratic univariate certificate on [-0.5, 0.75]^2 only; the expected-true property is certified with certified_upper_bound=0.6987500000000001 below threshold=0.72 and certificate_slack=0.02124999999999988, while the deliberate false threshold=0.68 is rejected with certificate_slack=-0.018750000000000044. |
