 | SCENARIO-HW-5255 | Exp 5255 writes SSH/hash continuity receipts and boundary notes without an acceleration claim | Scaffolding | Artifact records KV260 and PolarFire as reachable with board-local hash/correctness smoke receipts, carries GateMate forward as `blocked_physical_jtag` because `physical_setup_changed.value=false`, records p-kit and Extropic/Kona/Aleph boundary note paths, keeps `speedup_claimed.value=false`, and maps to blocked because honest_verdict.value contains `blocked`. |
+| REQ-CAPSTONE-5256 | .480 milestone capstone aggregator | Scaffolding | `python/carnot/experiment_5256_capstone_v480.py`; `tests/python/test_experiment_5256_capstone_v480.py`; `openspec/capabilities/capstone/spec.md`; `results/experiment_5256_capstone_v480.json`; honest_verdict={"principle":"Must start with complete: or blocked_ and state the honest .480 close state without laundering blocked, skipped, negative, zero-delta, or bounded artifacts.","value":"complete: .480 capstone closed with normalizer ready; GAP-4 salvaged clean null; cross-model memory and verifier dose blocked; Token-Guard harmful; HalluHard clean null; ARC delta 0 with patch retired; KAN bounded positive; hardware no-speedup."}; status=<missing>; tasks_seen=10; gap4_final_status=salvaged_clean_null wins=0 losses=0 ties=120; cross-model memory and verifier dose blocked; Token-Guard harmful; HalluHard clean null; arc_level_delta.value=0; hardware_speedup_claimed.value=false; no retro_* flags; no AUC/TP/FP/signed_improvement/violation_rate fields; mapped as blocked because the verdict contains `blocked`. |
+| SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-5256 | Principle-wrapped capstone artifact summarizes .480 sources without inflating claims | Scaffolding | Artifact emits required top-level fields and records Exp5245 blocked, Exp5246 missing, Exp5249 blocked, and Exp5250 gated_skipped; it preserves GAP-4 salvaged clean-null counts wins=0 losses=0 ties=120, Token-Guard harm, HalluHard null, ARC delta 0, bounded KAN positive, and no hardware speedup claim. |
+| SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-5256-FIELD-PRINCIPLES | Field principles constrain .480 capstone claims | Scaffolding | Required field principles are present, including honest_verdict principle that forbids laundering blocked, skipped, negative, zero-delta, or bounded artifacts; status is not Complete because the honest_verdict.value contains `blocked` and hardware no-speedup, with no retro_* closure flags. |
